    "text": "{\n  \"semantic_type\": \"flow\",\n  \"unit\": \"USD\",\n  \"additive_over_entities\": true,\n  \"additive_over_time\": false,\n  \"time_rollup\": \"reported_fy_value\",\n  \"valid_methods\": [\"sum_across_entities\", \"pct_change\"],\n  \"period_basis\": \"mixed\",\n  \"derivation\": \"As-filed XBRL value of us-gaap PaymentsToAcquirePropertyPlantAndEquipment. Rows carry different period bases: Q (single quarter), YTD6 and YTD9 (cumulative within the fiscal year) and FY (full year). Because the rows overlap, they must not be summed across periods. Single-quarter values for Q2-Q4 can be derived by differencing consecutive YTD values.\",\n  \"calendar\": \"fiscal\",\n  \"seasonal_adjustment\": \"NSA\",\n  \"annualized\": false,\n  \"entity_grain\": \"ticker\",\n  \"hierarchy\": null,\n  \"comparability\": \"same_definition\",\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"source\": \"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts API\",\n    \"url_template\": \"https://data.sec.gov/api/xbrl/companyfacts/CIK{cik}.json\",\n    \"concept\": \"PaymentsToAcquirePropertyPlantAndEquipment\",\n    \"retrieved_on\": \"2026-10-24\"\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Capital expenditures (cash paid to acquire property, plant and equipment) in USD for CMG, DRI, WING and YUM, as reported in 10-Q and 10-K filings. It is a cash-flow amount over a period, and each row's period_basis (Q, YTD6, YTD9, FY) shows how much of the fiscal year it covers. Use the FY value for annual totals. Compare or sum across companies only for the same period and period basis.\"\n}",
